# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# Root-path routing ("/") is handled by the edge function
# (functions/index.ts) which performs Accept-Language + cookie-based
# locale detection. Non-prefixed legacy paths are caught by
# functions/_middleware.ts and 301-redirected to /en/*.
#
# No blanket /* /en/:splat rule here — that would re-prefix already
# locale-prefixed paths and cause infinite /en/en/en/… redirect loops.